			"gates": ["GS-2"],
			"status": "ue_bar",
			"reason": "Provisional groups, as GS-9's on the kitbash set: the GodotNext group is the NextGI frame block (nextgi_* without the closing marker's column and line 1b), and the UE group is the three stat gpu passes the settings record names for the Lumen total, which leave out the Lumen scene update columns the captures also report. Which columns both totals take waits for the lead and the settings record (plan §23.5).",
